1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/llm/back-propagation","children":["大白话解释反向传播算法"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/back-propagation.jpg","alt":"大白话解释反向传播算法 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"大模型"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"大白话解释反向传播算法"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇用 CEO 追责分锅的比喻，深入浅出地解释反向传播算法的工作原理，从流水线管理到神经网络训练，帮助你理解这个深度学习的核心算法"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-27T12:30:20.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/27"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,638"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"一核心思想一个-分锅-大会","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#一核心思想一个-分锅-大会","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#一核心思想一个-分锅-大会"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"一、核心思想：一个 “分锅” 大会","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":5,"offset":4},"end":{"line":1,"column":22,"offset":21}}}]},"children":"一、核心思想：一个 “分锅” 大会"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"想象一下，你是一个大公司的 CEO，你的公司有一个很长的流水线，用来生产一个精密的产品。这条流水线有很多道工序，每道工序都有一个工人负责。"}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"最终产品出问题了"}],"：产品下线后，你发现最终的成品和设计图纸有偏差 (比如，要求重 100 克，结果做出来重 110 克)。这个 “10 克的偏差” 就是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"误差 (Error)"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"你作为 CEO 开始追责"}],"：你肯定不会把所有人都骂一顿，或者随机开除一个工人。最科学的方法是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"从后往前"}],"追查。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"追责第一步"}],"：你首先找到",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"最后一道工序"}]," 的工人。因为他是直接影响成品的人。你对他说：“产品重了 10 克，你的操作对最终重量影响最大，你先调整一下你的机器参数。”"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"追责第二步"}],"：这个工人会说：“老板，我这道工序的产出，也受到",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"上一道工序"}]," 给我的半成品的影响啊。根据我的机器参数，我可以计算出，上一个工人交给我的半成品大概是重了 8 克导致的。”"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"追责第三步"}],"：于是，你又拿着这个 “8 克的偏差” 去找",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"倒数第二个工人"}],"。这个工人也同样会计算他受到了他上游工序的影响。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"一路向前追溯"}],"：就这样，这个 “锅” (误差) 从最后一个工人开始，一层一层地",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"向前传递"}],"，每个工人都根据自己的 “责任” 大小，领走一部分 “锅”，并对自己的机器参数做出微小的调整。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["这个从后往前追责、分锅、调整的过程，就是 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"反向传播"}]," 的核心思想。"]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"二从比喻到神经网络","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#二从比喻到神经网络","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#二从比喻到神经网络"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"二、从比喻到神经网络","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":5,"offset":661},"end":{"line":14,"column":15,"offset":671}}}]},"children":"二、从比喻到神经网络"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"现在，我们把上面的比喻翻译成神经网络的术语："}],"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"大白话比喻"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"神经网络术语"}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":"解释"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"流水线"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"神经网络 (Neural Network)"}]}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"由多个层级组成，数据从输入层流向输出层。"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"工人"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"神经元 (Neuron)"}]}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"网络中的计算单元。"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"工人的机器参数"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"$L8"}],"$L9"]}],"$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]}]]}],"\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a"]}]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]}]]}]}]
